# Sylven OS Environment Configuration

# 1. GitHub API Token
# Required for live statistics.
# Generate a classic token with 'read:org' scope here: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# If left blank, the app will use mock data for local development.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# 2. Canonical Site URL
# Used for sitemap.xml, robots.txt, canonical links, and Open Graph/Twitter metadata.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://sylvenos.com